\b \cf0 Question:
\b0  Exactly what problems will AquaTransport fix?\

\b Answer
\b0 : It's difficult to provide a complete list, as it depends on your OS and what software and online services you use. If you see the error 
\b CFNetwork SSLHandshake failed (-9824)
\b0  in the Console app when things fail to load, that's a problem AquaTransport will fix.\
\

\b Question
\b0 : Instead of installing your package, I used a tool such as Pacifist to extract its contents and copied everything to my computer manually. Why isn't anything working?\

\b Answer
\b0 : Certain files are modified by the installer at runtime. If you really don't want to run the installer, take a look at the installer's postflight scripts.\
\

\b Question
\b0 : I have a question which isn't already listed here.\

\b Answer
\b0 : Send a message to 
\b Wowfunhappy \'95\'a0gmail.com
\b0  and I will do my best to help! Please feel free to send a second message if you don't hear back within a few days.
